Z||000000||polomeno||09-26-2000||12:22 PM||||Hey guys.. i have a 84 Coupe and it was starting  few weeks ago but now when i go to start it all i get is a "click" noise.. i've replaced the battery becasue it was almost dead anyways but i still only get the clicking noise when i turn the key.. i need a new starter?? i've tried hitting the starter incase maybe it's stuck but it didnt seem to do anything.. any suggestions?<P>thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||HugGRRRFiero||09-26-2000||12:26 PM||||I'd check the wire connections at the starter.  Make sure they aren't loose, corroded, frayed, etc.  If they look ok, probably time for a new starter.<P>------------------<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">        <BR>        <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||1
